    BOUNDARY CLOSE mid2.machine_design_noPortsNR1_closedB …
    GOALGAP mid2.machine_design_noPortsNR1_closedB_gap … (no gap_ hypothesis)
    NOPORTS MID2: …

| endpoint | premise | predicted state |
|---|---|---|
| `mid2.machine_design_noPortsNR1` (+ `_closed`) | `shipsHierCheck (childMap D.modules) b` of `mid2.machine_design_svNR1` | WRITTEN, NOT BUILT — predicted absent, pending build |
| | `kidsMaskedN D.modules b.body` | predicted absent, pending build |
| | `designCheck (childMap D.modules) 1 (checkedOptimize b)` (incl. `kidsPass`, `portsMatchB`) | predicted absent, pending build |
